      "subject": "בחר…בחר…רצה",
      "rationale": "Bokwetši bja 'go kgetha' bo phunyeletšwe gabedi; go phunyeletša ga lento le latelana ga di-kgetho bo ka se bontšhwe ka botlalo Sepeding."
    },
    {
      "kind": "alternative",
      "subject": "לנגיד",
      "rationale": "'Molaodi' goba 'kgoši ya pele' — nagana ya go ba le maemo a bohlokwa, e sego go ba le maatla ka botlalo."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme Yahwe, Elohim wa Yisraele, o kgethile nna go tšwa lelweng ka moka la ntatau ka go ba kgoši go Yisraele ka mehla; ka gobane o kgethile Yuda go ba molaodi, gomme lelweng la Yuda — leloo la ntatau; gomme gare ga bana ba ntatau — nna o ile a nratoga, go mpša kgoši go Yisraele ka moka.",
